{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Planet Earth... He has charted a course... For Revenge! Travel to distant star systems on a quest to free the galaxy from the tyrannical alien empire of the Anunnaki.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the Giant Crab and spread your trail of destruction far and wide in both planet-based and space-based levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of alien cities and installations for you to stomp all over. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devastating power ups to cause even more destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story based campaign of galactic liberation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat imposing alien military units including spider-mechs and massive starships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planet based \u201ckaiju mode\u201d and interstellar \u201cspace mode\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental Random Map Generator</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845770/extras/84c8aa501a2698631b8fe4058cbab132.poster.avif?t=1755400512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845770/extras/84c8aa501a2698631b8fe4058cbab132.webm?t=1755400512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845770/extras/84c8aa501a2698631b8fe4058cbab132.mp4?t=1755400512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ice To See You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com